  "intentionalMajorVersionChanges": [
    "Per-session provider composition replaces process-global name, module and context interceptor events. No aliases or global-hook compatibility surface remain.",
    "StaticModuleProvider with an empty export set replaces a zero-handle dynamic context. Dynamic handle adoption rejects zero before ownership transfer.",
    "NativeModuleSession exposes complete immutable required-symbol sets. Missing required addresses cannot become callable zero slots. Changed table layouts are constructed and validated as a new provider; live callable tables are never partially resized.",
    "Native array allocation and reserved-slot layouts remain available through BCL native memory and the explicit Runtime-only external table adapter. Borrowing does not free caller storage.",
    "BCL path and native-loader conventions replace loader-only path/extension helpers. The old IsExtensionSupported assertion always returned false and represented no implemented native extension discovery."
  ],
